# No AI / Cursor commit attribution

When creating commits or pull requests in this repository:

- **NEVER** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Claude`, `Co-authored-by: Auto`, `Co-authored-by: Composer`, or any AI/agent co-author trailer
- **NEVER** add `Made-with: Cursor`, `Generated with Cursor`, or similar attribution trailers/footers
- **NEVER** put agent names, model names, or “via Cursor/Claude/Auto” in commit subjects or bodies
- Commits must use **only** the user’s existing git identity (`user.name` / `user.email` already configured)
- **Do not** change `git config` (local or global), including identity or signing settings
- Prefer ordinary commit messages that look human-authored

```text
# ❌ BAD
feat: update homepage

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Made-with: Cursor

# ✅ GOOD
feat: update homepage hero copy for Beacon Awards
```
